# TutorMunk blog redirect map (updated 14 Aug 2026, full content bank)
#
# One line per migrated post: old sproutsacademy.com.au URL -> new
# tutormunk.com.au blog URL. Generated from the sourceUrl field in each
# post's markdown frontmatter (src/content/blog/*.md).
#
# IMPORTANT: this file deploys on the SPROUTS ACADEMY domain's server at
# switchover (sproutsacademy.com.au), not on TutorMunk's own
# deploy/.htaccess. It tells the OLD domain where to send visitors who
# still have an old article URL bookmarked or ranked in Google.
#
# selective-test-timeline and naplan-writing are original TutorMunk posts
# with no Sprouts source, so they have no redirect lines. Most targets are
# staged as drafts until switchover; flip drafts live BEFORE deploying
# these redirects so no redirect lands on a 404.

